```http
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### 1. LOGIN ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### 2. LOGIN SELLER
# @name loginSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "seller",
  "password": "Seller123!"
}
###


### 3. LISTAR ROLES — ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

### 4. CONSULTAR ROL POR ID — ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

### 5. CREAR ROL — ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AUDITOR",
  "description": "Solo lectura de catálogo"
}

###

### 6. ACTUALIZAR ROL COMPLETO — ADMIN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AUDITOR",
  "description": "Auditoría operativa"
}

###

### 7. ACTUALIZAR ROL PARCIAL — ADMIN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Auditoría operativa actualizada"
}

###

### 8. DESACTIVAR ROL — ADMIN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/3/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

### 9. ELIMINAR ROL FÍSICAMENTE — ADMIN
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

### 10. PRUEBA DE AUTORIZACIÓN — SELLER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.$.access_token}}
```